{
    "title": "BOMTOON - \u6b63\u7248\u6388\u6b0a\u7db2\u6f2b",
    "description": "More fun from BOM\r\nQuickly do the following self-test, if you meet more than one item,\r\nCome and experience the new world of comics!\r\n\r\n1. Fans of BL and GL? ( Yes or No )\r\nThe most interesting BL, GL and Romance comics are all at your fingertips!\r\n\r\n2. Want to support legitimate original work at the best price? ( Yes or No )\r\nFree coupons and various discount activities allow you to enjoy cultural life without burden!\r\n\r\n3. It\u2019s super easy to get involved in the story, and you cry and laugh along with it if you\u2019re not careful? ( Yes or No )\r\nTurn on the continuous reading mode, so that your throbbing is not interrupted!\r\n\r\n4. Are there works that are inconvenient to collect physical books? ( Yes or No )\r\nThe My Bookcase function allows you to easily manage your private work book list!\r\n\r\n5. Do you have a special preference for works? ( Yes or No )\r\nUse the tag function to define the type you like!\r\n\r\n\r\n \u3010Follow us\u3011\r\nBOMTOON official website: https://www.bomtoon.tw/\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/BomtoonTW/\r\nInstagram : https://www.instagram.com/bomtoon_tw/\r\nTwitter : https://twitter.com/BomtoonTW\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions, please feel free to contact us through the customer service center of the website or APP.\r\nThe customer service center is open from Monday to Friday (working days), from 9:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. Taiwan time.\r\n\r\n\u203bAccess right within the BOMTOON app\r\n1. Necessary access rights: Storage\r\n- Save files such as pictures\r\n2. Selective Access: Camera\r\n- Photos from the user's album",
    "descriptionHTML": "More fun from BOM<br>Quickly do the following self-test, if you meet more than one item,<br>Come and experience the new world of comics!<br><br>1. Fans of BL and GL? ( Yes or No )<br>The most interesting BL, GL and Romance comics are all at your fingertips!<br><br>2. Want to support legitimate original work at the best price? ( Yes or No )<br>Free coupons and various discount activities allow you to enjoy cultural life without burden!<br><br>3. It\u2019s super easy to get involved in the story, and you cry and laugh along with it if you\u2019re not careful? ( Yes or No )<br>Turn on the continuous reading mode, so that your throbbing is not interrupted!<br><br>4. Are there works that are inconvenient to collect physical books? ( Yes or No )<br>The My Bookcase function allows you to easily manage your private work book list!<br><br>5. Do you have a special preference for works? ( Yes or No )<br>Use the tag function to define the type you like!<br><br><br> \u3010Follow us\u3011<br>BOMTOON official website: https://www.bomtoon.tw/<br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/BomtoonTW/<br>Instagram : https://www.instagram.com/bomtoon_tw/<br>Twitter : https://twitter.com/BomtoonTW<br><br>If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us through the customer service center of the website or APP.<br>The customer service center is open from Monday to Friday (working days), from 9:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. Taiwan time.<br><br>\u203bAccess right within the BOMTOON app<br>1. Necessary access rights: Storage<br>- Save files such as pictures<br>2. Selective Access: Camera<br>- Photos from the user&#39;s album",
